      No rule's number is written into any sentence here. "Your minimum runway", not "three months":
      that figure is RULE-EMERG-FIRST's, and a copy in a string is a mirror nothing checks. The amounts
      that do appear arrive as arguments, formatted from the engine's own figures (P-03).

      Advice, not instructions (P-07): every action is phrased as a suggestion, and the screen says in
      as many words that nothing moves unless the user moves it.
    -->
